Bind Npc 16052 Zone 2

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910051000
        Say "I am the Watcher, the Guardian of the Second Key!  You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [First Key]. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "What did the god Pathos originally govern?"
            Topic "The God of Change" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910051000
                    Give 1 of 910052000
            Topic "The God of Creation" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910051000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Pathos is the god of change and chaos, opposite to Logos. As a penalty, the [First Key] you possessed has been destroyed. Now, I will leave to search for the secret of the keys elsewhere."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I am the Watcher, the Guardian of the Second Key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [First Key]."
    Else
        Say ""
